    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CHARLOTTE: Yeah, it is.\nKELLY: ...Oh my god you have to try it, this power cleanse is amazing- it's lemon juice and grade B maple syrup and cayenne pepper for seven days. …\nCHARLOTTE: Hi again, how's it going?",
      "NEW SINGER: Good Evening. I'm Carl West, and we're thrilled to be joining you this week, here at the NY bar in Shinjuku.\nSINGER: Jt seems we stood and talked like this before, we looked at each other in the same way thenr but I cant remember where or when...",
      "CHARLOTTE: I don't know, it just doesn't, reality changes things....we can't stay here forever, unless maybe we started a Jazz band.\nSINGER: Somethings that happen for the first time, seem to be happening again and so it seems we have met before, and laughed before, and loved befo…"
    ]
